abstract: >-
  A hands-on curriculum for the write path of agent memory — extraction, entity
  resolution, conflict detection, belief updating, consolidation, decay and
  governance — across 84 lessons with a runnable Python lab each and a capstone
  system, memlab, that grows across three levels. Prose is CC BY 4.0; code is MIT.
